(module aslVdom/themeCodegenTest :x [runTests testSwiftuiTokenModifiers testComposeTokenModifiers testWebCssVariablesEmission! testD77NegativeControls] :i [(aslVdom/vdom :a v) (aslVdom/polyglot :a poly)])

fn testSwiftuiTokenModifiers -> Bool
  (let [(bgAttrs (mapSet (mapEmpty) "token-bg" "primary")) (colorAttrs (mapSet (mapEmpty) "token-color" "text")) (combinedAttrs (mapSet (mapSet (mapSet (mapSet (mapEmpty) "token-bg" "surface") "token-color" "primary") "token-padding" "md") "token-radius" "lg")) (spacingAttrs (mapSet (mapEmpty) "token-spacing" "sm")) (radiusSmAttrs (mapSet (mapEmpty) "token-radius" "sm")) (radiusMdAttrs (mapSet (mapEmpty) "token-radius" "md")) (radiusLgAttrs (mapSet (mapEmpty) "token-radius" "lg")) (numericPaddingAttrs (mapSet (mapEmpty) "token-padding" "24")) (bgMods (poly/emitSwiftuiModifiers bgAttrs)) (colorMods (poly/emitSwiftuiModifiers colorAttrs)) (spacingMods (poly/emitSwiftuiModifiers spacingAttrs)) (radiusSmMods (poly/emitSwiftuiModifiers radiusSmAttrs)) (radiusMdMods (poly/emitSwiftuiModifiers radiusMdAttrs)) (radiusLgMods (poly/emitSwiftuiModifiers radiusLgAttrs)) (numPaddingMods (poly/emitSwiftuiModifiers numericPaddingAttrs)) (combinedMods (poly/emitSwiftuiModifiers combinedAttrs)) (btnNode (v/elem "button" combinedAttrs (list (v/text "Themed Action")))) (viewCode (poly/emitSwiftuiView "ThemeDemo" btnNode))] (assert (= bgMods ".background(Color.primary)") "SwiftUI token-bg must emit .background(Color.primary)") (assert (= colorMods ".foregroundColor(Color.text)") "SwiftUI token-color must emit .foregroundColor(Color.text)") (assert (= spacingMods ".padding(8)") "SwiftUI token-spacing sm must emit .padding(8)") (assert (= radiusSmMods ".cornerRadius(2)") "SwiftUI token-radius sm must emit .cornerRadius(2)") (assert (= radiusMdMods ".cornerRadius(4)") "SwiftUI token-radius md must emit .cornerRadius(4)") (assert (= radiusLgMods ".cornerRadius(8)") "SwiftUI token-radius lg must emit .cornerRadius(8)") (assert (= numPaddingMods ".padding(24)") "SwiftUI token-padding numeric 24 must emit .padding(24)") (assert (stringContains? combinedMods ".background(Color.surface)") "Combined modifiers must contain background") (assert (stringContains? combinedMods ".foregroundColor(Color.primary)") "Combined modifiers must contain foregroundColor") (assert (stringContains? combinedMods ".padding(16)") "Combined modifiers must contain padding 16") (assert (stringContains? combinedMods ".cornerRadius(8)") "Combined modifiers must contain cornerRadius 8") (assert (stringContains? viewCode "Button(action: {})") "SwiftUI View must emit Button") (assert (stringContains? viewCode ".background(Color.surface)") "SwiftUI View must attach background modifier") (assert (stringContains? viewCode ".foregroundColor(Color.primary)") "SwiftUI View must attach foregroundColor modifier") (assert (stringContains? viewCode ".padding(16)") "SwiftUI View must attach padding modifier") (assert (stringContains? viewCode ".cornerRadius(8)") "SwiftUI View must attach cornerRadius modifier") true)

fn testComposeTokenModifiers -> Bool
  (let [(bgAttrs (mapSet (mapEmpty) "token-bg" "primary")) (paddingAttrs (mapSet (mapEmpty) "token-padding" "md")) (spacingAttrs (mapSet (mapEmpty) "token-spacing" "sm")) (radiusSmAttrs (mapSet (mapEmpty) "token-radius" "sm")) (radiusMdAttrs (mapSet (mapEmpty) "token-radius" "md")) (radiusLgAttrs (mapSet (mapEmpty) "token-radius" "lg")) (numericPaddingAttrs (mapSet (mapEmpty) "token-padding" "32")) (combinedAttrs (mapSet (mapSet (mapSet (mapEmpty) "token-bg" "surface") "token-padding" "md") "token-radius" "md")) (bgMod (poly/emitComposeModifierArg bgAttrs)) (paddingMod (poly/emitComposeModifierArg paddingAttrs)) (spacingMod (poly/emitComposeModifierArg spacingAttrs)) (radiusSmMod (poly/emitComposeModifierArg radiusSmAttrs)) (radiusMdMod (poly/emitComposeModifierArg radiusMdAttrs)) (radiusLgMod (poly/emitComposeModifierArg radiusLgAttrs)) (numPaddingMod (poly/emitComposeModifierArg numericPaddingAttrs)) (combinedMod (poly/emitComposeModifierArg combinedAttrs)) (btnNode (v/elem "button" combinedAttrs (list (v/text "Themed Action")))) (composableCode (poly/emitComposeComposable "ThemeDemo" btnNode))] (assert (= bgMod "modifier = Modifier.background(Color.Primary)") "Compose token-bg must emit Modifier.background(Color.Primary)") (assert (= paddingMod "modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)") "Compose token-padding md must emit Modifier.padding(16.dp)") (assert (= spacingMod "modifier = Modifier.padding(8.dp)") "Compose token-spacing sm must emit Modifier.padding(8.dp)") (assert (= radiusSmMod "modifier = Modifier.clip(RoundedCornerShape(2.dp))") "Compose token-radius sm must emit clip(RoundedCornerShape(2.dp))") (assert (= radiusMdMod "modifier = Modifier.clip(RoundedCornerShape(4.dp))") "Compose token-radius md must emit clip(RoundedCornerShape(4.dp))") (assert (= radiusLgMod "modifier = Modifier.clip(RoundedCornerShape(8.dp))") "Compose token-radius lg must emit clip(RoundedCornerShape(8.dp))") (assert (= numPaddingMod "modifier = Modifier.padding(32.dp)") "Compose numeric padding 32 must emit .padding(32.dp)") (assert (stringContains? combinedMod "modifier = Modifier") "Combined modifier must start with Modifier") (assert (stringContains? combinedMod ".background(Color.Surface)") "Combined modifier must contain background") (assert (stringContains? combinedMod ".padding(16.dp)") "Combined modifier must contain padding(16.dp)") (assert (stringContains? combinedMod ".clip(RoundedCornerShape(4.dp))") "Combined modifier must contain clip") (assert (stringContains? composableCode "Button(onClick = {}, modifier = Modifier") "Compose Button must receive modifier with comma separation") (assert (stringContains? composableCode ".background(Color.Surface)") "Composable code must include background") (assert (stringContains? composableCode ".padding(16.dp)") "Composable code must include padding") (assert (stringContains? composableCode ".clip(RoundedCornerShape(4.dp))") "Composable code must include clip") true)

fn testWebCssVariablesEmission! -> Bool
  (let [(btnAttrs (mapSet (mapSet (mapSet (mapSet (mapSet (mapEmpty) "class" "theme-button") "token-bg" "primary") "token-color" "text") "token-padding" "md") "token-radius" "sm")) (btnNode (v/elem "button" btnAttrs (list (v/text "Web Themed Button")))) (reactCode (poly/emitReactTsx "WebThemeDemo" "WebThemeProps" btnNode)) (htmlCode (poly/emitSsrHtml btnNode)) (vueCode (poly/emitVueSfc "WebThemeDemo" "WebThemeProps" btnNode)) (svelteCode (poly/emitSvelteComponent "WebThemeDemo" "WebThemeProps" btnNode))] (println (str "COUNT=" (stringFromInt64 (listLength (mapPairs btnAttrs))))) (println reactCode) (assert (stringContains? reactCode "export const WebThemeDemo = (props: WebThemeProps) => {") "React TSX must export functional component") (assert (stringContains? reactCode "className=\"theme-button\"") "React TSX must map class to className") (assert (stringContains? reactCode "style={{") "React TSX must emit JSX style object") (assert (stringContains? reactCode "backgroundColor: \"var(--color-primary)\"") "React TSX must reference --color-primary CSS variable") (assert (stringContains? reactCode "color: \"var(--color-text)\"") "React TSX must reference --color-text CSS variable") (assert (stringContains? reactCode "padding: \"var(--spacing-md)\"") "React TSX must reference --spacing-md CSS variable") (assert (stringContains? reactCode "borderRadius: \"var(--radius-sm)\"") "React TSX must reference --radius-sm CSS variable") (assert (stringStartsWith? htmlCode "<button class=\"theme-button\"") "HTML SSR must open with button tag and class") (assert (stringContains? htmlCode "style=\"") "HTML SSR must emit style attribute") (assert (stringContains? htmlCode "background-color: var(--color-primary);") "HTML SSR must contain background-color CSS variable") (assert (stringContains? htmlCode "color: var(--color-text);") "HTML SSR must contain color CSS variable") (assert (stringContains? htmlCode "padding: var(--spacing-md);") "HTML SSR must contain padding CSS variable") (assert (stringContains? htmlCode "border-radius: var(--radius-sm);") "HTML SSR must contain border-radius CSS variable") (assert (stringEndsWith? htmlCode ">Web Themed Button</button>") "HTML SSR must close button tag") (assert (stringContains? vueCode "<template>") "Vue SFC must contain template block") (assert (stringContains? vueCode "background-color: var(--color-primary);") "Vue SFC must contain background-color CSS variable") (assert (stringContains? svelteCode "$props()") "Svelte 5 must declare runes $props") (assert (stringContains? svelteCode "background-color: var(--color-primary);") "Svelte component must contain background-color CSS variable") true)

fn testD77NegativeControls -> Bool
  (let [(themedAttrs (mapSet (mapSet (mapSet (mapSet (mapEmpty) "token-bg" "primary") "token-color" "text") "token-padding" "md") "token-radius" "lg")) (btnNode (v/elem "button" themedAttrs (list (v/text "Submit")))) (swiftMods (poly/emitSwiftuiModifiers themedAttrs)) (composeMods (poly/emitComposeModifierArg themedAttrs)) (swiftCode (poly/emitSwiftuiView "Login" btnNode)) (composeCode (poly/emitComposeComposable "Login" btnNode)) (reactCode (poly/emitReactTsx "Login" "LoginProps" btnNode)) (htmlCode (poly/emitSsrHtml btnNode)) (emptyBgAttr (mapSet (mapEmpty) "token-bg" "")) (emptyPaddingAttr (mapSet (mapEmpty) "token-padding" "")) (emptyRadiusAttr (mapSet (mapEmpty) "token-radius" ""))] (refute (stringEmpty? swiftMods) "SwiftUI modifiers must not be empty when token attributes are present") (refute (stringEmpty? composeMods) "Compose modifier must not be empty when token attributes are present") (refute (stringContains? swiftCode "token-bg") "SwiftUI view must not leak raw token-bg attribute key") (refute (stringContains? composeCode "token-bg") "Compose view must not leak raw token-bg attribute key") (refute (stringContains? reactCode "token-bg") "React TSX must not leak raw token-bg attribute key") (refute (stringContains? htmlCode "token-bg") "HTML SSR must not leak raw token-bg attribute key") (refute (stringContains? reactCode "token-padding") "React TSX must not leak raw token-padding attribute key") (refute (stringContains? htmlCode "token-padding") "HTML SSR must not leak raw token-padding attribute key") (refute (stringContains? swiftCode "token-radius") "SwiftUI view must not leak raw token-radius attribute key") (refute (stringContains? composeCode "token-radius") "Compose view must not leak raw token-radius attribute key") (refute (stringContains? htmlCode "token-radius") "HTML SSR must not leak raw token-radius attribute key") (refute (stringContains? swiftMods "#2563eb") "Refute raw primary hex in SwiftUI modifiers") (refute (stringContains? swiftMods "#ffffff") "Refute raw background hex in SwiftUI modifiers") (refute (stringContains? swiftMods "#0f172a") "Refute raw text hex in SwiftUI modifiers") (refute (stringContains? swiftMods "0x") "Refute hex numeric literal in SwiftUI modifiers") (refute (stringContains? swiftCode "#2563eb") "Refute raw primary hex in SwiftUI View code") (refute (stringContains? composeMods "#2563eb") "Refute raw primary hex in Compose modifiers") (refute (stringContains? composeMods "#ffffff") "Refute raw background hex in Compose modifiers") (refute (stringContains? composeMods "#0f172a") "Refute raw text hex in Compose modifiers") (refute (stringContains? composeMods "0xFF") "Refute hex numeric literal in Compose modifiers") (refute (stringContains? composeCode "#2563eb") "Refute raw primary hex in Compose Composable code") (refute (stringContains? swiftCode " background(Color.") "Refute SwiftUI modifier missing opening dot for background") (refute (stringContains? swiftCode " foregroundColor(Color.") "Refute SwiftUI modifier missing opening dot for foregroundColor") (refute (stringContains? swiftCode " padding(16)") "Refute SwiftUI modifier missing opening dot for padding") (refute (stringContains? swiftCode " cornerRadius(8)") "Refute SwiftUI modifier missing opening dot for cornerRadius") (refute (stringContains? composeCode ")modifier = Modifier") "Refute Compose argument missing comma before modifier") (refute (stringContains? composeCode "onClick = {}modifier = Modifier") "Refute Compose Button onClick missing comma before modifier") (refute (stringContains? composeCode "Modifierbackground") "Refute Compose modifier missing dot before background") (refute (stringContains? composeCode "Modifierpadding") "Refute Compose modifier missing dot before padding") (refute (stringContains? composeCode "Modifierclip") "Refute Compose modifier missing dot before clip") (refute (stringContains? (poly/emitSwiftuiModifiers emptyBgAttr) "Color.") "Refute empty token-bg creating invalid Color. modifier in SwiftUI") (refute (stringContains? (poly/emitComposeModifierArg emptyBgAttr) "Color.") "Refute empty token-bg creating invalid Color. modifier in Compose") (refute (stringContains? (poly/emitSwiftuiModifiers emptyPaddingAttr) ".padding()") "Refute empty token-padding creating empty padding in SwiftUI") (refute (stringContains? (poly/emitComposeModifierArg emptyPaddingAttr) ".padding(.dp)") "Refute empty token-padding creating .padding(.dp) in Compose") (refute (stringContains? (poly/emitSwiftuiModifiers emptyRadiusAttr) ".cornerRadius()") "Refute empty token-radius creating empty cornerRadius in SwiftUI") (refute (stringContains? (poly/emitComposeModifierArg emptyRadiusAttr) ".clip(RoundedCornerShape(.dp))") "Refute empty token-radius creating corrupt shape in Compose") (refute (stringContains? reactCode "undefined") "Refute undefined in React TSX output") (refute (stringContains? reactCode "null") "Refute null in React TSX output") (refute (stringContains? reactCode "NaN") "Refute NaN in React TSX output") (refute (stringContains? htmlCode "undefined") "Refute undefined in HTML SSR output") (refute (stringContains? htmlCode "null") "Refute null in HTML SSR output") (refute (stringContains? htmlCode "NaN") "Refute NaN in HTML SSR output") true)

fn ! runTests -> Bool
  (and (testSwiftuiTokenModifiers) (and (testComposeTokenModifiers) (and (testWebCssVariablesEmission!) (testD77NegativeControls))))
